OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1787080720
OL,3,CRoad closed after lorry fire spreads
OL,4,Cto grass verge
OL,6,FA main road has been closed in
OL,7,FSomerset after a lorry caught fire,
OL,8,Fwhich then spread to a grassy verge.
OL,10,FThe A303 is closed westbound between
OL,11,Fthe A358 at Horton Cross and the A30
OL,12,Fat Upottery.
OL,14,FThe lorry was fully laden with
OL,15,Fvegetation, and the fire spread to the
OL,16,Fadjacent grass verge.
OL,18,FFire and Rescue teams attended and
OL,19,Fhave extinguished the fire and crews
OL,20,Fremain on scene carrying out recovery
OL,21,Fand clear-up work.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/2
