OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1787080720
OL,3,CRoad closed after lorry fire spreads
OL,4,Cto grass verge
OL,6,FThe incident occurred shortly before
OL,7,F9pm yesterday evening.
OL,9,FThe eastbound carriageway was also
OL,10,Fclosed but reopened at 7am on Tuesday
OL,11,FAugust 18.
OL,13,FThere is currently a diversion in
OL,14,Fplace and all drivers are being asked
OL,15,Fto plan their journey in advance.
OL,17,FRoad users travelling westbound are
OL,18,Fadvised to follow the solid triangle
OL,19,Fdiversion symbol on road signs:
